avarice-rt-stdlib

This crate contains source code taken from Astra
<https://github.com/ArkForgeLabs/Astra>, Copyright (c) ArkForge Labs, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.

Files that are byte-for-byte Astra's carry no header of their own, so that they
stay identical to it; UPSTREAM.md lists every such file with the Astra file it
is and its checksum. Each file that differs from Astra's opens with a header
naming the Astra file it came from and listing what was changed. Astra
distributes no NOTICE file, so this one is not inherited from it.
